# Admin credentials are no longer configured here. The first visitor to a
# fresh deployment creates the admin account through the setup wizard, and it
# is stored in D1 (migrations/0011_admins.sql).
#
# NOTE: the admin password is stored in D1 as a salted PBKDF2-SHA256 hash.
# See the header of workers/lib/password.ts for the parameters and the measured
# CPU cost.

# Optional: require a shared secret before the setup wizard will run.
# Recommended when the deployment is reachable from the public internet.
# SETUP_TOKEN=some-long-random-string
